TITLE:Pillar 5 Step 4
H1:Pillar 5 · Step 4: side jobs <span class="draft">summary · drafts for review</span>
SUB:Step 4 adds the side jobs you can do once you're an Officer (and a few cozy off-shift things): optional, never needed to rank up, there for as long as you like. Ten spec pages, a build order and a seat split for a small overnight team. Written by the Pillar 5 designer for lead 16; for the user's morning review. No game code.
NAV:what=What's in it|order=Build order|seats=Seats|calls=Lead's calls|check=Check-in|pages=All pages

